WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.550
Business Support Programs.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:14.100
CEWS, CEBA, CECRA, CERS — the alphabet soup of business supports represented the largest transfer of public funds to the private sector in Canadian history.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:21.350
PBO analysis and CRA data document both their massive scale and the accountability questions they raise.
